# dealCombatDamageStep only calls dealAttackerDamage when power > 0
# (combatdamage.go's own "if power, ok := atk.Power(); ok && power > 0"
# guard) -- Ornithopter (0/2, Flying, irrelevant here since block legality
# beyond untapped is not built) attacks unblocked and deals nothing at all,
# not even a zero-amount DamageDealt event.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
